---
description: Keep recurring toolbar actions compact and icon-only
globs: frontend/src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Toolbar action buttons

- Render filter actions as an outlined 32×32 icon button with only the funnel icon.
- Render refresh actions as an outlined 32×32 icon button with only the refresh icon.
- Do not put visible text or counters inside these buttons.
- Always provide an accessible `title` and `aria-label`.
